{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14031","headline":"奉送崔侍御和蕃 · 耿湋","name":"奉送崔侍御和蕃","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里华戎隔，风沙道路秋。\n新恩明主启，旧好使臣修。\n旌节随边草，关山见戍楼。\n俗殊人左袵，地远水西流。\n日暮冰先合，春深雪未休。\n无论善长对，博望自封侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}